(The snare catches the wolf before it can get to you. It futily snaps its jaws, but cannot reach.)
Viktor: Add a dialogue puzzle here?
Are you Ser Merrok, (who served the Round Table until tricked to be a wolf?)
Viktor: This would be a good spot for another dialogue puzzle - need to learn about Percy's connection to King Pellinore.
merrok: (The wolf calms itself.)
merrok: Aye, I am Ser Merrok. I know you. You must be the begotten of King Pellinore. I apologize for my hostility. I am here to ensure the guests do no harm to this place.
I'm King Pellinore's son, Percivel. You knew my father?
merrok: He is the one who sent me to my lord Thiess when I lost my human pelt. For that I owe him my gratitude, but I am to understand he is years past now.
Yeah, it's been centuries since he was buried.
merrok: Then you shall inherit my gratitude. If there is aught I can do to aid you, then simply speak of it to me, though I must be clear\: my Lord Thiess had sent me here to aid in the control of spirits.
- (There"s a creature I need help finding.) | [if {questProgress.questingBeast.investigationStatus} == "howtrack"] [else="hide"]
	merrok: What manner of beast do you speak of?
	(Talk about the questing beast.)
	merrok: I see. Is my help truly needed here? Are not vermin the responsibility of (employees) already here?
	One would think, but Bediwyr has not been able to even catch sight of it. I thought perhaps a hound such as yourself would be able to track it where men can't.
	...No offense.
	merrok: None intended, and none taken, O Percivel. However, if I am to seek out this beast for you, it will require me to forsake my current duties.
	Viktor: (Here we go, here's an opportunity for a dialogue puzzle - but what would the phrase be? Who do we have accessible at this point?)
	label puzzleFailLoop
	Viktor: Autosolve the puzzle for now?
	- No
		jump puzzleFailLoop
	- Yes
		merrok: If you are able to calm the riff-raff, then I suppose I will eagerly help you.
	set {questProgress.questingBeast.investigationStatus} = "merrokhelp"
- (I'll let you know.)
	merrok: Then if you would release me, I shall return to making order amongst the riff-raff here.
(Should I release him now?)
- Don't release yet
	Sorry, you'll need to stay there for a bit.
	set {convo_progress.merrok.merrokCaught} = true
